Holger Schwender wrote:
> Hi Tao,
> 
> at least for the Plus2 and the X3P chip, the order of hgu133plus2probe and pm(...) slightly differ.

It depends on what we get from Affy. The probe packages are based on the 
Affymetrix XXX_probe_tab files, which list things out a particular 
order, and the cdfs are based on the cdf files. If Affy happened to list 
things out in the same order for both input files, then things will line 
up. If not, then they won't ;-D


As Holger says, these two are slightly different. I wouldn't be 
surprised if that were true for all the chips (and I wouldn't be 
surprised if some were 100% consistent either...).

Best,

Jim


